ith-a-glass-floor-and-trapdoor-that-went-on-to-win-shed-of-the-year-in-2017/articleshow/134811651.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-12-year-old-surrey-girl-handed-her-father-500-of-savings-and-asked-for-a-mushroom-shaped-house-he-built-a-two-storey-backyard-hideaway-with-a-glass-floor-and-trapdoor-that-went-on-to-win-shed-of-the-year-in-2017/articleshow/134811651.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T12:05:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134812570,imgsize-175000.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Shannen Doherty’s Malibu sanctuary sells for $7.65M after $9.5M posthumous listing]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134810634.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Shannen Doherty's stunning Malibu home, originally priced at $9.5 million, has now sold for $7.65 million after several price adjustments. This five-bedroom residence was a refuge for Doherty during her courageous fight against cancer. Following the severe damage from the Woolsey Fire in 2018, significant renovations restored its charm and elevated its desirability.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2004-shannen-doherty-paid-2-56-million-for-a-malibu-home-she-called-her-sanctuary-22-years-later-after-a-9-5-million-posthumous-listing-and-price-cut-the-property-sold-for-7-65-million/articleshow/134810634.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2004-shannen-doherty-paid-2-56-million-for-a-malibu-home-she-called-her-sanctuary-22-years-later-after-a-9-5-million-posthumous-listing-and-price-cut-the-property-sold-for-7-65-million/articleshow/134810634.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T12:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI 