icleshow/134785511.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-21-year-old-tennessee-moviegoer-noticed-an-80-year-old-amc-usher-emptying-trash-after-a-screening-and-hoped-a-tiktok-fundraiser-might-bring-in-500-strangers-donated-more-than-146000-in-less-than-24-hours/articleshow/134785511.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T11:05:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134786117,imgsize-74348.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘The Orange Plague’: Why a golden, naked Trump is sitting on another man]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134808403.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-orange-plague-why-a-golden-naked-trump-is-sitting-on-another-man/articleshow/134808403.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/the-orange-plague-why-a-golden-naked-trump-is-sitting-on-another-man/articleshow/134808403.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T10:32:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134808881,imgsize-71214.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Irvine Ranch Conservation Effort: Donald Bren preserves 57,500 acres; land stays open for future generations]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134806185.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Billionaire real-estate developer Donald Bren transformed a significant part of the historic Irvine Ranch into protected public lands. After becoming chairman of the Irvine Company, he spearheaded major conservation milestones over the years. The Irvine Ranch now has over 57,000 acres preserved, providing habitats for diverse wildlife. In 2005, the Irvine Ranch Conservancy was established to ensure the ongoing care of these protected areas.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/billionaire-donald-bren-led-the-permanent-protection-of-more-than-57500-acres-of-californias-historic-irvine-ranch-nearly-60-of-the-property-almost-40000-acres-later-received-national-natural-landmark-status/articleshow/134806185.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/billionaire-donald-bren-led-the-permanent-protection-of-more-than-57500-acres-of-californias-historic-irvine-ranch-nearly-60-of-the-property-almost-40000-acres-later-received-national-natural-landmark-status/articleshow/134806185.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T10:03:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134806230,imgsize-2271376.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Eviction Approved In Long Foreclosure: magistrate orders Telerico out; buyback talks continue]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134804985.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In an ongoing foreclosure saga in Aurora, Ohio, Louis Telerico faces eviction after a lengthy battle. The mansion was sold to ERADAL in July 2026, yet Telerico continues to occupy the home, seeking a deal to buy it back. As ERADAL evaluates the property for restoration amid legal challenges, doubts linger over Telerico's financing options to reclaim his estate.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2011-an-ohio-man-was-served-foreclosure-papers-on-his-4-5-million-17000-sq-ft-mansion-after-nearly-15-years-of-hearings-mediation-and-court-fights-an-eviction-notice-has-now-been-approved/articleshow/134804985.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2011-an-ohio-man-was-served-foreclosure-papers-on-his-4-5-million-17000-sq-ft-mansion-after-nearly-15-years-of-hearings-mediation-and-court-fights-an-eviction-notice-has-now-been-approved/articleshow/134804985.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T10:03:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134804998,imgsize-2179307.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Richard Branson bought an island to impress a girl, later bought $15 million Moskito Island]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134800186.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Richard Branson was 29 when he pursued an island to impress Joan Templeman, offering $100,000 for a property priced at $6 million before eventually buying it for $180,000. In 2007, he purchased 125-acre Moskito Island for $15 million. Today, the island has been divided among nine private families who own estates there.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/richard-branson-was-29-when-he-bought-an-island-to-impress-a-girl-offered-100000-for-a-6-million-property-in-2007-he-bought-125-acre-moskito-island-for-15-million-now-divided-among-nine-families/articleshow/134800186.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/richard-branson-was-29-when-he-bought-an-island-to-impress-a-girl-offered-100000-for-a-6-million-property-in-2007-he-bought-125-acre-moskito-island-for-15-million-now-divided-among-nine-families/articleshow/134800186.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T01:26:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134800219,imgsize-95251.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Woman pays £80 for Dior bag, later discovers it's rare 2003 Koi Saddle Bag worth £7,870]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134800032.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A woman unknowingly found herself in a designer dream when she bought a Dior handbag for just £80 at a Cotswolds charity shop. After authenticating the bag at Kinghams, it was revealed to be a limited-edition Koi Saddle Bag from 2003, ultimately selling for a breathtaking £7,870. This instance illustrates how brilliant bargains can emerge outside of luxury boutiques.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-woman-paid-about-80-for-a-dior-bag-in-a-cotswolds-charity-shop-without-knowing-if-it-was-genuine-experts-identified-it-as-a-rare-2003-koi-saddle-bag-and-it-later-sold-for-7870/articleshow/134800032.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-woman-paid-about-80-for-a-dior-bag-in-a-cotswolds-charity-shop-without-knowing-if-it-was-genuine-experts-identified-it-as-a-rare-2003-koi-saddle-bag-and-it-later-sold-for-7870/articleshow/134800032.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T01:16:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134800152,imgsize-333269.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mark Zuckerberg’s sister Arielle reveals secret DJ career, 37-year-old playing techno since 2018]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134799153.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Mark Zuckerberg’s sister Arielle Zuckerberg has revealed her secret DJ career, saying she has been DJing since 2018. The 37-year-old venture capitalist has played techno sets at clubs, small festivals and Burning Man. She described DJing as a “side quest,” saying she mostly performs with friends for fun and to spread joy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mark-zuckerbergs-sister-arielle-zuckerberg-reveals-secret-dj-career-37-year-old-has-played-techno-at-clubs-festivals-and-burning-man-since-2018-while-working-in-venture-capital/articleshow/134799153.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mark-zuckerbergs-sister-arielle-zuckerberg-reveals-secret-dj-career-37-year-old-has-played-techno-at-clubs-festivals-and-burning-man-since-2018-while-working-in-venture-capital/articleshow/134799153.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T00:21:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134799231,imgsize-94993.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Pentagon to livestream Nidal Hasan's firing squad execution on December 3]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134805300.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-plans-to-livestream-fort-hood-shooters-death-first-public-execution-in-90-years/articleshow/134805300.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-plans-to-livestream-fort-hood-shooters-death-first-public-execution-in-90-years/articleshow/134805300.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T08:59:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134805375,imgsize-83290.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['ICE out of our neighbourhoods’: Shooting of man sparks protests in New York]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134804207.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-out-of-our-neighbourhoods-shooting-of-dominican-man-sparks-protests-in-new-york/articleshow/134804207.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-out-of-our-neighbourhoods-shooting-of-dominican-man-sparks-protests-in-new-york/articleshow/134804207.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T07:44:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134804237,imgsize-129704.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Margaret Hamilton, scientist who worked on Nasa's Apollo programme, dies]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134803936.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Margaret Hamilton, an American scientist known for her work on NASA's Apollo program, has recently passed away. She played a crucial role in developing the software for the Apollo missions, ensuring safe lunar landings. Hamilton's contributions to computing have been recognized widely, including the awarding of the Presidential Medal of Freedom. Her work not only advanced technology but also inspired future generations in science and engineering.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/margaret-hamilton-scientist-who-worked-on-nasas-apollo-programme-dies/articleshow/134803936.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/margaret-hamilton-scientist-who-worked-on-nasas-apollo-programme-dies/articleshow/134803936.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T07:09:25+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134803934,imgsize-96976.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Family Asks For Privacy: FGTeeV Duddy’s ‘demons’ rant alarms fans; KreekCraft says he needs help]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134800437.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[FGTeeV Duddy sparked concern after calling his family “the devil” and “demons” during an Instagram Live. He later said those comments did not reflect how he sees his children. Roblox creator KreekCraft said the family wanted the videos removed and asked viewers to give them privacy. The situation has drawn widespread attention across social media as the family handles events.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/fgteev-duddy-sparks-concern-after-calling-wife-children-demons-during-shocking-instagram-live/articleshow/134800437.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/fgteev-duddy-sparks-concern-after-calling-wife-children-demons-during-shocking-instagram-live/articleshow/134800437.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-09T02:20:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134800438,imgsize-576903.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Logo Sketch Auction: MrBeast’s 2018 tiger art heads to sale; estimate tops $20,000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134802792.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[MrBeast’s original pencil sketch of his iconic tiger logo is heading to Heritage Auctions from October 23 to 25, 2026, with an estimated value of $20,000 or more. Created around 2018 during a 10-minute brainstorming session, the drawing predates the familiar blue design and pink lightning bolt. Despite the auction’s connection to his brand, IGN confirmed that the YouTube star is not involved in the sale.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streame